IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-LIGHTSEQ-V3.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-LAYERS          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 BATCH-SIZE          PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 HIDDEN-DIM          PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 LAUNCH-LATENCY-NS   PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LIGHTSEQ.
    IF NUM-LAYERS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 95 TO LAUNCH-LATENCY-NS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-LAYERS.
    WEIGHT 30 LAUNCH-LATENCY-NS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
